<!-- A0: hand-crafted informal prompt (human baseline before formalization) -->

Write a small Python dev unit named refund_payment.

Requirements:
- Put the main function in refund_demo/refund_payment.py as refund_payment(amount: int) -> int.
- Use a helper module refund_demo/helper.py with adjust(amount) that returns amount plus one.
- refund_payment should return adjust(amount).

Keep the public API as a single function: refund_payment.
